@page "/"

<PageTitle>Ant Design X Blazor</PageTitle>

<section class="VPHero has-image">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="main">
            <h1 class="name">
                <span class="clip">Ant Design X Blazor</span>
            </h1>
            <p class="text">AI 体验新秩序</p>
            <p class="tagline">Ant Design X For Blazor。基于 RICH 设计范式，打造卓越 AI 界面解决方案，引领智能新体验。</p>

            <div class="actions">
                <div class="action">
                    <a class="VPButton brand" href="component/overview">开始使用</a>
                </div>
                <div class="action">
                    <a class="VPButton alt" href="https://x.ant.design/docs/spec/introduce-cn" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">设计语言</a>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="image">
            <div class="image-container">
                <div class="image-bg"></div>
                <DocsHeroVisual />
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="VPFeatures">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="items">
            <article class="VPFeature">
                <h2>AI 设计范式 - RICH</h2>
                <p>创造卓越 AI 产品体验</p>
            </article>
            <article class="VPFeature">
                <h2>AI 界面解决方案</h2>
                <p>基于 RICH，全新 AGI 混合界面（Hybrid-UI）解决方案，完美融合 GUI 和自然会话交互。</p>
            </article>
            <article class="VPFeature">
                <h2>组件丰富，选用自如</h2>
                <p>Ant Design X Blazor 全新 AI 组件，大量实用组件满足你的需求，灵活定制与拓展。</p>
            </article>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
